{"id":54315,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54315"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:41:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:41:21","slug":"sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026<\/strong> (62\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da *S\u00e3o Silvestre da Cidade de Ponta Delgada*) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na ilha de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Miguel<\/strong>, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Sendo uma das mais antigas e emblem\u00e1ticas corridas de fim de ano de Portugal, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">18:30<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini-Corrida de 1,3 km<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:00<\/strong> a partida da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida Principal de 6,2 km<\/strong> e da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado urbano, totalmente encerrado ao tr\u00e2nsito, leva-te a correr sob a ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o festiva do centro hist\u00f3rico de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ponta Delgada<\/strong>, passando pela frente mar\u00edtima da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida Infante Dom Henrique<\/strong> e pelas ic\u00f3nicas <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Portas da Cidade<\/strong>. A prova principal contempla duas voltas num total de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6.200 metros<\/strong> (para escal\u00f5es Sub-18 a Veteranos VII), a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada<\/strong> percorre uma volta de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">4.000 metros<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong> disputa-se numa volta curta de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1.300 metros<\/strong> dedicada aos escal\u00f5es Sub-10 a Sub-16 e Desporto Adaptado.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Miguel (AASM)<\/strong> e limitada \u00e0s primeiras <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">2.026 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal personalizado com nome (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 30 de novembro), trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o e equipas, e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 5 da geral M\/F e para os 3 melhores atletas micaelenses. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C