or: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 1,3 km (Sub-10 a Sub-16 e Desporto Adaptado)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 18:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 30\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/10 a 10\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a 62\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, no centro hist\u00f3rico de Ponta Delgada (Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores). A Mini-Corrida (1,3 km) parte \u00e0s 18:30, enquanto a Corrida Principal (6,2 km) e a Caminhada (4 km) partem \u00e0s 19:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para a Corrida Principal (6,2 km) e Caminhada (4 km), os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o de 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 30 de setembro, 13,00 \u20ac de 1 a 30 de outubro e 16,00 \u20ac de 31 de outubro a 10 de dezembro. Na Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre (1,3 km para Sub-10 a Sub-16 e Desporto Adaptado), os valores s\u00e3o de 8,00 \u20ac, 9,00 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac nas respetivas fases. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza ainda pacotes tur\u00edsticos com estadia e voo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o limite de participantes e at\u00e9 quando h\u00e1 dorsal personalizado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento est\u00e1 limitado \u00e0s primeiras 2.026 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es, encerrando a 10 de dezembro de 2026. Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es efetuadas e pagas at\u00e9 30 de novembro t\u00eam direito a dorsal personalizado com o nome do atleta e garantia do tamanho escolhido para a t-shirt oficial.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es que participam em cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Mini-Corrida de 1,3 km (1 volta pequena) destina-se aos escal\u00f5es Sub-10, Sub-12, Sub-14, Sub-16 e Desporto Adaptado. A Corrida Principal de 6,2 km (2 voltas) abrange os escal\u00f5es Sub-18, Sub-20, Seniores e Veteranos I a VII (M\/F). A Caminhada de 4 km \u00e9 aberta a todas as idades sem fins competitivos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, nos 6,2 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral M\/F (150 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 100 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 80 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 50 \u20ac ao 4\u00ba e 30 \u20ac ao 5\u00ba) e aos 3 melhores atletas micaelenses M\/F (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o e para as 5 melhores equipas masculinas e femininas.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ponta Delgada, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ponta Delgada\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 62\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada 2026 realiza-se a 12 de dezembro nos A\u00e7ores. Corrida de 6,2 km, Caminhada de 4 km e Mini 1,3 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada (6,2 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada S\u00e3o Silvestre (4 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 1,3 km (Sub-10 a Sub-16 e Desporto Adaptado)\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada-2026\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.or