I a VII (M\/F). A Caminhada de 4 km \u00e9 aberta a todas as idades sem fins competitivos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ponta Delgada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, nos 6,2 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral M\/F (150 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 100 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 80 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 50 \u20ac ao 4\u00ba e 30 \u20ac ao 5\u00ba) e aos 3 melhores atletas micaelenses M\/F (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o e para as 5 melhores equipas masculinas e femininas.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70218,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,478,624,47],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54315","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ponta-delgada-acores","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-ponta-delgada.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54315","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=54315"}]